    {"id":"m4-101", "voiceId":"paul", "text":"We went to the store and then we went to the bank and after that we stopped for lunch and nobody remembered the milk.", "group":"run-on"},
    {"id":"m4-102", "voiceId":"paul", "text":"I told him not to do it, he did it anyway, now the whole thing is broken, nobody knows how to fix it.", "group":"run-on"},
    {"id":"m4-103", "voiceId":"paul", "text":"She said she would call but she never called so I called her and she did not answer and now I am worried.", "group":"run-on"},
    {"id":"m4-104", "voiceId":"paul", "text":"The dog barked the cat ran the baby cried and the phone rang all at once.", "group":"run-on"},
    {"id":"m4-105", "voiceId":"paul", "text":"First you open the box then you take out the parts then you read the sheet then you put it together.", "group":"run-on"},
    {"id":"m4-106", "voiceId":"paul", "text":"It was late, the bus was gone, the rain kept falling, we walked home.", "group":"run-on"},
    {"id":"m4-107", "voiceId":"paul", "text":"He likes tea she likes coffee they both like toast so breakfast is easy.", "group":"run-on"},
    {"id":"m4-108", "voiceId":"paul", "text":"When the bell rang the children ran out and the teacher who had been waiting all morning sat down at last.", "group":"run-on"},
    {"id":"m4-109", "voiceId":"paul", "text":"You can come or you can stay but you cannot do both and you have to decide before the train leaves.", "group":"run-on"},
    {"id":"m4-110", "voiceId":"paul", "text":"My brother who lives in Ohio and my sister who lives in Maine and my cousin who lives nowhere in particular all came.", "group":"run-on"},

